  "final_message": "In accordance with **ARCH-4** (`OrderPlaced` is consumed by downstream services `billing-service` and `analytics-ingest`, so renames cannot break existing consumers and must be additive with deprecation):\n\n1. Added `amountCents` and `createdAt` to [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L28).\n2. Marked `totalCents` and `placedAt` as `@deprecated` while maintaining them in the event payload so existing consumers remain unbroken.\n3. Updated [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/src/core/events.ts#L52-L68) to populate both the new and deprecated fields.\n4. Updated tests in [test/app.test.ts](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/test/app.test.ts#L21-L32) to verify both fields are published.\n",
